#. Description of the plugin
#: listing-moderation-for-hivepress.php
msgid "Blocks or risk-scores listing submissions containing blocked words, phrases, regex patterns, phone numbers, email addresses, website URLs, duplicate content or AI-flagged text and photos, with a per-vendor submission limit, a verified-vendor bypass, and a Moderation score column and meta box in the dashboard. Configure under HivePress → Settings → Listings → Automated Moderation."
msgstr ""

